175					// Two-phase progress: a "Placing" spinner covers the fast
176					// CreateMirror call (placement, <15s), then a separate "Cloning"
177					// spinner covers the clone-readiness poll. An already-ready mirror
178					// completes the first poll faster than the spinner's initial delay,
179					// so the Cloning line never paints and we go straight to the clone
